{
  "_comment": [
    "Messages that name one program type (Kurs / Veranstaltung / Studiengang /",
    "course / event / degree) while living in a namespace shown for courses,",
    "events and degrees alike. CONTEXT.md lists 'Kurs/Veranstaltung used",
    "interchangeably' under things to avoid.",
    "",
    "A frozen baseline, not a target. messages.test.ts fails for any NEW such",
    "message and for any entry here that no longer matches, so the lists only",
    "shrink. Clear one by giving its key a neutral `other` ('Angebot' /",
    "'offering') plus the per-type overrides that need the precise noun --",
    "see hooks/useProgramTypeTranslations.ts.",
    "",
    "Some entries are already correct: a few keys (e.g. course.degree_elements.*)",
    "render only for one program type, so naming it there is accurate. They are",
    "listed because the check cannot tell which keys are type-scoped; clearing",
    "them means confirming that and removing the entry."
  ],
